flowchart TD
    USER[Plain-English request] --> ENTRY[CLI or Streamlit]
    ENTRY --> PLAN[Plan and validate plan]
    PLAN <--> LLM[LLM client: Gemini, Groq, or Ollama]
    PLAN --> CODE[Generate Python code]
    CODE <--> LLM
    CODE --> EXEC[Execute attempt]
    EXEC --> API[Allowlisted API broker]
    API <--> CACHE[API response cache]
    API --> SOURCES[Open-Meteo APIs]
    API --> INPUT[Approved response snapshots]
    EXEC --> SANDBOX[Isolated Python subprocess]
    INPUT --> SANDBOX
    SANDBOX --> STAGE[Attempt staging database]
    STAGE --> VALIDATE[Pandera and SQL validation]
    META[Expected schemas and table ownership] --> VALIDATE
    VALIDATE -->|Pass| PUBLISH[Transactional publish]
    PUBLISH --> DB[Validated DuckDB warehouse]
    PUBLISH --> META
    VALIDATE -->|Fail| FIX[Diagnose and propose distinct repair]
    EXEC -->|Execution error| FIX
    FIX <--> LLM
    FIX -->|Repair budget remains| EXEC
    FIX -->|Budget exhausted or unsafe repair| FAILURE[Failure report]
    DB --> ANOMALY[Z-score and IQR detection]
    ANOMALY --> REPORT[Markdown report]
    REPORT --> ENTRY
    FAILURE --> ENTRY
    PLAN -.-> LOG[Structured run log]
    EXEC -.-> LOG
    VALIDATE -.-> LOG
    FIX -.-> LOG
    PUBLISH -.-> LOG
    ANOMALY -.-> LOG
